			"Settings": {
				"Code": "vec2 p = UV - vec2_splat(0.5);\nfloat border = 1.0-smoothstep(0.44,0.5,max(abs(p.x),abs(p.y)));\nfloat lines = .78 + .22*sin(UV.y*190.0*3.14159265);\nfloat roll = 1.0-smoothstep(0.0,0.075,abs(UV.y-fract(Clock*.12)));\nfloat n = fract(sin(dot(floor(UV*vec2(240.0,180.0)),vec2(12.9898,78.233))+floor(Clock*24.0))*43758.5453);\n// Abstract terminal windows and cursor, with no extra screen texture.\nfloat window = step(abs(UV.x-.5),.36)*step(abs(UV.y-.42),.28);\nfloat textRows = step(.77,fract(UV.y*22.0))*step(UV.x,.7)*step(.2,UV.x)*step(.19,UV.y)*step(UV.y,.59);\nfloat cursor = step(abs(UV.x-.3),.035)*step(abs(UV.y-.64),.008)*step(.3,fract(Clock));\nvec3 display = Tint*(.10 + window*.13 + textRows*.30 + cursor*.7 + roll*.1 + n*.035);\nColor = display*lines*border*Gain;",
				"Inputs": [
					{
						"Name": "UV",
						"Type": "Vec2"
					},
					{
						"Name": "Clock",
						"Type": "Float"
					},
